\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb7 For now, the extra coordinates are mathematical bookkeeping. To make them physically meaningful, the next task is to demonstrate that distinctions hidden by the instantaneous observation affect subsequent dynamics.\cf0 \cb1 \
