\cf2 \cb7 Your seven-dimensional constraint doesn't make every speculative thesis true. But it substantially expands the set of structures we can explore, and it reveals a mathematically exact mechanism for quarter-turn cyclicity that wasn't explicit in Haiku's derivation.\cf0 \cb1 \
